# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
# Built after the title song (music/title.scrim). 6/8, a vibraphone tune like water, a rocking
# pizzicato, crystal drips falling at odd places.
title    Roots
composer Claude
about    The first dark under the grass, in 6/8: a vibraphone tune in D minor like water in the dark, a rocking pizzicato, crystal drips falling at odd places, glass harmonica chords and a low fretless bass; the glass bird calls at the phrase ends. When something is near, a cracked crystal ostinato ticks over a glass heartbeat, a bodhran and a woodblock; a kit and the tune come back as it comes for you, a horn, drive and breaking glass for a fight, choir and gong for a guardian.
tempo    58
beats    2
steps    6
reverb   0.45

# moods (music/README.md)
# mood explore:  lead drips ost pad bass bird
# mood treasure: ost pad bird wonder
# mood sense:    crack heart bodhran block pad bass bowl
# mood rise:     sense -bowl lead kick snare
# mood fight:    rise -heart -block horn drive war smash
# mood boss:     fight -lead choir gong

voice lead     vibes      vol=0.55 pan=-0.1 rev=0.5
voice drips    crystal    vol=0.24 pan=0.45 rev=0.75
voice ost      pizz       vol=0.48 pan=0.25 gate=0.6
voice pad      glassharp  vol=0.2  pan=-0.25 center=A3 att=0.4 rel=0.8
voice bass     fretless   vol=0.7  glide=0.08
voice bird     crystal    vol=0.5  pan=0.4  rev=0.7
voice wonder   crystal    vol=0.28 pan=-0.35 rev=0.6
voice crack    crystal    vol=0.4  pan=-0.3
voice heart    glasstap   vol=0.3  pan=0.1
voice bodhran  bodhran    vol=0.5  pan=-0.2
voice block    block      vol=0.32 pan=0.35
voice bowl     bowl       vol=0.28 pan=0.15 rev=0.6
voice kick     kick       vol=0.5
voice snare    snare      vol=0.36 pan=0.1
voice horn     horn       vol=0.7  pan=0.2  oct=-1 att=0.025 rel=0.12 rev=0.3
voice drive    pizz       vol=0.55 pan=-0.35 gate=0.55 rev=0.25
voice war      tommid     vol=0.5  pan=0.15 rev=0.2
voice smash    shatter    vol=0.35 pan=-0.2
voice choir    voices     vol=0.28 center=D3 att=0.5 rel=0.8
voice gong     gong       vol=0.3  pan=-0.3

